{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026SnEaYqVJHM1794916556.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國家主席習近平在深圳會見加拿大總理卡尼。他表示中加關係改善、發展，有利於維護世界和平穩定。</p><p></p><p>國家主席習近平表示：「事實證明，中加關係改善、發展符合兩國人民的利益，也有利於維護世界和平穩定和發展繁榮，這是一個正確的選擇。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T15:36:10.450005+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T14:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T16:30:39.306952+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T15:29:29.153082+00:00","content_hash":"2bed7911eba1af6d5e6c3cf446c5075e716d4b4ceb7e60b12e8acaa07399f186","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T15:36:10.450005+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}